{"id":23031,"name":"我将，巡征追猎","rarity":5,"path":"Rogue","desc":"巡猎命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"<i>「可悲可笑的奴隶们……」</i>\\n浩荡的丰饶民军队压境而来，狼毒如洪水般涌向青丘军，试图唤起军士深埋于心中的恐惧，化作种种可怖的幻象，使他们垂下武器，犹豫不前。\\n但阵线犹如铜墙铁壁，不为步离人轻蔑的话音所动，一个身影缓步走出。\\n她缓缓活动着身体，无形的煞气冲击下，旗帜猎猎作响。\\n<i>「将军，是将军出现了……」</i>\\n<i>「飞霄将军……」</i>\\n<i>「『天击』将军！」</i>\\n细微的呼唤汇聚起来，化作震天的战吼。\\n\\n<i>「翾翔不坠，万载常胜！」</i>\\n她站在那里，一个人，就像一支军队。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":23031,"name":"震慑","desc":"使装备者的暴击率提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[f1]%</unbreak></color>。装备者施放追加攻击时，获得1层【流光】，最多叠加<unbreak>#3[i]</unbreak>层。每层【流光】使装备者造成的终结技伤害无视目标<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>的防御力。装备者回合结束时，移除1层【流光】。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.15,0.27,2]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.175,0.3,2]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.2,0.33,2]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.225,0.36,2]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.25,0.39,2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":43.2,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":28.8,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":21,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":5000},{"ItemID":113011,"ItemNum":8}]},"1":{"hp_base":95.04,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":63.36,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":46.2,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":10000},{"ItemID":110191,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":113011,"ItemNum":12}]},"2":{"hp_base":164.16,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":109.44,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":79.8,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":20000},{"ItemID":110192,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":113012,"ItemNum":8}]},"3":{"hp_base":233.28,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":155.52,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":113.4,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":50000},{"ItemID":110192,"ItemNum":8},{"ItemID":113012,"ItemNum":12}]},"4":{"hp_base":302.4,"hp_add":6.48,"attack_base":201.6,"attack_add":4.32,"defence_base":147,"defence_add":3.15,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":100000},{"ItemID":110193,"ItemNum":5},{"ItemID":113013,"ItemNum":6}]},"5":{"hp_ba